before:
Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java
import java.util.List;
public class Main {

  public static void main(String[] args) {
    var result = List.of(1, 2, 3, 4).stream()
        .filter(n -> n % 2 == 0).map(n -> n * 10).toList();
    System.out.println(result);
  }
}
```

after:
var lets Java work out result's fixed type from its starting expression. Follow the stream steps from left to right.

```java
import java.util.List;
public class Main {

  public static void main(String[] args) {
    var result = List.of(1, 2, 3, 4).stream()
        .filter(n -> n % 2 == 0).map(n -> n * 10).toList();
    System.out.println(result);
  }
}
```
